@startuml ssd-probe-runtime-cycle
' Reasoning: the runtime cycle is a black-box polling interaction. The probe
' asks BEACON for runtime/configuration data and receives executable work state.
title BEACON - SSD - Probe Runtime Cycle

autonumber

actor "Probe Runtime" as probe
participant "BEACON Platform" as beacon

probe -> beacon : Poll runtime eligibility
beacon --> probe : Return status and execution eligibility
probe -> beacon : Poll configuration and assigned plugins
beacon --> probe : Return enabled tests and plugin bundle metadata
probe -> beacon : Download required plugin bundles
beacon --> probe : Return plugin bundle archives

@enduml
